1
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:13,777
yuppie

2
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:17,300
yIELDing!

3
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,957
Everything is in place Kaiba and
little Yugi should be arriving

4
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:11,020
momentarily With the hopeless
plan of rescuing you two However,

5
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:15,637
with both of you as my mind slaves
They'll have no choice but to play by my

6
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:21,120
rules Their Egyptian god cards and
Yugi's puzzle Will be mine for the taking

7
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:24,880
And soon I'll rule the whole world

8
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,780
Isn't that right, my friends?

9
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:35,597
You're so quiet Almost as if you don't have
minds of your own When little Yugi sees

10
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:41,060
his best friends in my control He'll have
no choice but to obey me Master Merrick,

11
00:01:41,380 --> 00:01:43,660
I beg your pardon What now?

12
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,140
As you requested,

13
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:50,280
sir I've secured 12 locator cards
for the Battle City Finals Excellent,

14
00:01:50,460 --> 00:01:54,237
Odeon You've done well Now we both qualify

15
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:57,720
to participate in the
finals If we need to.

16
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,021
Hopefully that won't be required.

17
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:03,880
In which case you've wasted
a great deal of time.

18
00:02:04,300 --> 00:02:06,080
But hand them over anyway.

19
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:10,340
Entering the finals may be
necessary if today's plan fails.

20
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,477
It's a privilege to serve you.

21
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:16,660
I always have a backup plan to
ensure that I get what I want.

22
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:19,540
But today's setup seems foolproof.

23
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:23,720
Now hand my servant the deck
we've prepared for him, Odeon.

24
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,717
Yes, master.

25
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:29,020
When Yugi is forced to battle
against his brainwashed best friend,

26
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:30,900
he's sure to lose it all!

27
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:35,557
Replacing his pathetic deck
with an unstoppable assortment

28
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:38,637
of extremely rare magic
cards was an excellent idea,

29
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:39,602
Master Merrick.

30
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:43,797
This is my most ingenious scheme yet.

31
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:47,780
I took the things that mean
the most to Yugi, his friends.

32
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:50,757
Brilliant plan, Master. I know.

33
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:55,740
Now come and find me, little Yugi,
for the last duel you'll ever fight!

34
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:01,856
As soon as we land, Mokuba
will lead us to my friends.

35
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:04,600
We'll break in and get them out.

36
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:09,760
Look, Yugi, I brought you here and
I'll be calling all the shots today.

37
00:03:10,100 --> 00:03:15,720
And the first task on my agenda is to
track down the third Egyptian God Guard.

38
00:03:16,100 --> 00:03:18,777
After that, we'll find your friends.

39
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:19,700
Kaiba!

40
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:24,160
Joey and Teya are in great danger,
and we must rescue them right away!

41
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:29,097
Sorry, but it's obvious that you and I
have very different priorities, Yugi.

42
00:03:29,180 --> 00:03:32,768
So why don't we split up and
fend for ourselves when we land?

43
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,920
That's foolish!

44
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:38,540
Maybe it is to you, but I've always
worked much better on my own.

45
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:42,253
Haven't you realized by now
that teamwork's not my thing?

46
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:46,048
When we battled against Loomis
and Umbra in that double duel,

47
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:47,897
it was me who defeated them.

48
00:03:47,980 --> 00:03:49,820
and without much help.

49
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:54,580
So do me a favor and stay out of my
way, Yugi, because we're finished.

50
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,780
I brought you here.

51
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:59,557
Now you can take care
of the rest by yourself.

52
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,875
I've done enough charity work already.

53
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,740
Sorry, I'm through.

54
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:06,877
Then I'll save my friends
without Kaiba's help.

55
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:09,640
We're approaching our
target now, Mr. Kaiba.

56
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,567
Hey, guys, I think I
see someone on the pier.

57
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,820
And it kind of looks like Joey.

58
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:18,460
Oh, it is Joey,

59
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:21,900
and he seems to be all alone Get ready,

60
00:04:22,060 --> 00:04:25,740
my mind slave The fun
is about to begin Kaiba,

61
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:29,500
we may be heading into a trap Yugi,

62
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:33,380
please I've heard enough out
of you for one day All right,

63
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:38,517
little Yugi This is it When that
fool realizes I've turned his

64
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:42,640
best friend against him He'll be
completely devastated Ha ha ha!

65
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:46,950
Yugi!

66
00:04:47,033 --> 00:04:49,180
It's over for you! Welcome!

67
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:50,670
Joey!

68
00:04:50,753 --> 00:04:51,680
Not exactly.

69
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:55,120
Joey is not present. He's gone away.

70
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:57,560
It's Merrick! That's correct.

71
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,977
And if you want your friends
back, you will listen to me.

72
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:02,040
What's going on?

73
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:04,220
That sure doesn't sound like Joey.

74
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:07,680
It must be one of Merrick's
tricks. Listen, Joey!

75
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:09,500
You've got to be in there!

76
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,297
It's pointless.

77
00:05:11,380 --> 00:05:13,120
Now, you listen, Yugi.

78
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,980
We are playing by my regulations.

79
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:20,280
I'll release your pathetic friends
as soon as I get what I want.

80
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:24,700
Of course, since I want your
puzzle and Egyptian god card,

81
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,020
there's only one way to do this.

82
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:29,140
You and I are going to duel.

83
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,480
You're insane.

84
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:33,900
Refuse, and your friends are mine forever.

85
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,960
Release Joey from your control, Merrick.

86
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:40,880
What's going on, bro?

87
00:05:41,580 --> 00:05:42,410
Well, Mokuba,

88
00:05:42,493 --> 00:05:47,048
it appears that this Marek was somehow
able to turn Joey Wheeler against Yugi.

89
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,940
Now Wheeler wants to duel.

90
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:52,240
This should be interesting,
to say the very least.

91
00:05:52,820 --> 00:05:54,380
Interesting? But why?

92
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:59,177
Well, if Wheeler is fighting on the
side of Marek and the Rare Hunters now,

93
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:01,966
he may be holding the
third Egyptian God card.

94
00:06:02,180 --> 00:06:06,620
And I want that card in my deck, so
if it's played, I want to be there.

95
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:10,702
It's time to seize the power that
should have been mine all along.

96
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:13,220
Joey, I know you can hear me.

97
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:18,157
Your mind is under the control of Merrick,
and you must break free, understand?

98
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:21,120
The same Merrick you
vowed to help me crush.

99
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:22,490
Think, Joey,

100
00:06:22,573 --> 00:06:26,597
you've got to remember your promise
to me when you gave me your red eyes.

101
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,510
It's true.

102
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,137
We'll whoop this Merrick
creep in his rare hunter

103
00:06:30,220 --> 00:06:32,997
goon squad so hard they
won't know what hit him.

104
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:36,177
They'll be sorry that they
ever decided to mess with us.

105
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:40,737
Marek couldn't defeat me in a
duel So he decided to turn you

106
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:44,597
against me In order to win my
puzzle and my Egyptian god card

107
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:49,077
Joey I know you're in there
and I'm going to set you free

108
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:53,260
Marek's power is feeble compared
to the strength of our friendship

109
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,620
Please say something, Joey Joey!

110
00:06:57,300 --> 00:07:00,960
You'll never set him free
Unless you follow me, Yugi

111
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,400
Joey, wait!

112
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,257
What do I do?

113
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:08,317
Following Joey may lead to
another one of Merrick's traps.

114
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:11,694
But if I don't go, how will
I ever rescue Joey and Taya?

115
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:15,080
Yugi, you'd better do exactly as I say.

116
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:16,460
Oh no, Taya!

117
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:19,400
This may come as an unpleasant surprise,

118
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:23,340
but like your friend Joey,
Taya too is under my control.

119
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,670
Surprised?

120
00:07:26,753 --> 00:07:28,500
Merrick, leave her alone now!

121
00:07:28,940 --> 00:07:30,469
She's done nothing to you!

122
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:35,900
Looks like I've turned your closest
friends into your greatest enemies.

123
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,480
You're at my mercy.

124
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:38,950
Tear!

125
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:43,620
Welcome to my very special dueling arena.

126
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:44,961
Look around you.

127
00:07:45,180 --> 00:07:46,157
Should you accept,

128
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,917
you'll be battling against your
best friends in a duel like

129
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:52,840
none you've ever experienced for
the highest stakes imaginable.

130
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:55,380
All right, let's duel.

131
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:58,737
If it means saving my
friends. Let's begin.

132
00:07:58,820 --> 00:08:01,380
Why don't you both try these on for size?

133
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,637
Notice that you're both
securely fastened to a

134
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:10,080
chain that leads to a large
anchor hanging above you.

135
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:13,740
Thirty seconds after a player's
life points reach zero,

136
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:16,766
the anchor will drop to
the bottom of the sea.

137
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,060
That's right.

138
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:19,260
Now look down.

139
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:23,140
That small yellow box is
your life point counter,

140
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:25,957
but it also contains the
key to your survival.

141
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:28,720
When one player's life points reach zero,

142
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:33,295
the other player's box opens, revealing
a key that unlocks his shackles.

143
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:37,817
Remember, you'll have 30 seconds to
free yourself before the anchor drops.

144
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:41,597
So the loser of this duel will be
dragged to the bottom of the ocean,

145
00:08:41,680 --> 00:08:44,621
while the winner frees
himself at the last minute.

146
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,550
That's right.

147
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,520
Quite ingenious, isn't it?

148
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:49,910
But wait!

149
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:54,417
If I win this duel, will you set my
friends free from your control, Merrick?

150
00:08:54,500 --> 00:08:57,117
You'll have to fish Joey
out of the sea first.

151
00:08:57,200 --> 00:09:00,057
And don't think I left little
Taya out of all the fun,

152
00:09:00,140 --> 00:09:02,081
but I'll get to her role shortly.

153
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:06,560
And just in case you had any plans
of refusing to duel, think again.

154
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,037
If there's no winner within 60 minutes,

155
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:13,377
the anchor will automatically drop, sending
both of you plummeting into the sea.

156
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,290
Ha-ha-ha!

157
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,200
But you will lose, Yugi.

158
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:19,260
And before that anchor drops,

159
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:22,897
I'll take your Millennium Puzzle
and your Egyptian God card.

160
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:23,810
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

161
00:09:23,893 --> 00:09:27,560
You're not going to get away
with any of this, Merrick. Ha!

162
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:31,817
And Seto Kaiba, don't think you're
merely a spectator in all this.

163
00:09:31,900 --> 00:09:34,477
As soon as I'm through with
little Yugi and his friends,

164
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:37,384
I'm setting my sights on
your Egyptian god card,

165
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:39,120
Obelisk the Tormenter.

166
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,426
All right, I've heard enough.

167
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,637
This duel is getting
way out of hand, Seto.

168
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:47,217
You've gotta put a stop to
it before someone gets hurt.

169
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:50,418
Plus, Merrick may try
something like this on us next.

170
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:55,117
As head of the Battle City Tournament,
I demand that this duel be stopped now.

171
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:58,100
Sorry, but the duel will
continue as planned.

172
00:09:58,580 --> 00:10:02,000
And speaking of plans, here's
the final piece of my plot.

173
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,880
Hey, what's that?

174
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,540
Above Taya!

175
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:08,620
Taya, what is the
meaning of this, Merrick?

176
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:13,000
I'm afraid that anchor won't be
the only thing getting dropped.

177
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:20,760
I've taken extra measures to
make sure no one interferes.

178
00:10:20,980 --> 00:10:21,917
So don't try.

179
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:27,820
If you attempt to stop this duel, the crate
you see hanging over my head will fall.

180
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:31,100
You wouldn't put poor
Taya in danger, would you?

181
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,040
Make one false move and I push the button,

182
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:36,751
releasing the crate above the girl's head.

183
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,120
I can't stop this duel.

184
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:41,677
Now that everything seems to be in place

185
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,977
and everyone is familiar
with all the rules,

186
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,537
why don't we start the show?

187
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:47,640
Oh, wait, I almost forgot.

188
00:10:48,020 --> 00:10:50,667
I wouldn't want little
Taya to miss all this.

189
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,670
Thea!

190
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,937
Where am I?

191
00:10:59,020 --> 00:11:00,220
What's going on?

192
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,200
Hey, I'm trapped!

193
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,820
Now then, there's one last matter.

194
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:08,640
Yu-Gi, your Egyptian
God card is off limits.

195
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:12,797
So if you were planning on using
it against me, you're out of luck.

196
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:16,597
Now remove the card from your
deck so I may claim it when I win.

197
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:18,120
As you wish, Merrick.

198
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:21,080
I keep my special cards in here.

199
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,717
I wasn't going to use Slifer anyway.

200
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,918
It's too dangerous.

201
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:26,420
Wait a second.

202
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:28,957
I know something that may be able to help.

203
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,800
Joey's Red-Eyes Black Dragon.

204
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,340
Here you go, Joey.

205
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:33,950
Nah, Uke.

206
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,640
You hold on to it.

207
00:11:35,820 --> 00:11:37,408
It isn't mine to take, pal.

208
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:42,162
Besides, this means that a part
of me will be a part of your deck.

209
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:46,791
Anyway, I know it's going to
come in handy for you someday.

210
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:51,120
This red eyes meant so much to Joey,

211
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:54,257
and he gave it to me as
a sign of our friendship.

212
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:56,117
Well, I'm putting it in my deck.

213
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,517
I know the real Joey
is in there somewhere,

214
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:02,157
and maybe there's a way I can use
this card to save him from Merrick.

215
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:04,700
Now place Slifer on the ground, Yugi.

216
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:12,400
So whoever wins will retrieve that
card while the loser goes swimming.

217
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:19,040
Soon I'll possess Slifer the
Sky Dragon and Yugi's puzzle.

218
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:20,900
My plan won't fail.

219
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:25,900
I think it's finally
time to begin this duel.

220
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,670
Yugi?

221
00:12:27,753 --> 00:12:28,583
Versus Joey?

222
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:30,920
Are you ready to duel, Yugi?

223
00:12:31,220 --> 00:12:32,220
I am.

224
00:12:32,420 --> 00:12:33,300
Let's do this.

225
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,400
Prepare to lose, fool.

226
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,280
It's time to duel.

227
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:43,420
Well, we finally made it, Serenity. Great.

228
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,830
Huh.

229
00:12:44,913 --> 00:12:46,312
You grew up here, right?

230
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:49,337
I bet it's been ages since
you've been back, hasn't it?

231
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:50,250
Yep.

232
00:12:50,333 --> 00:12:52,917
Joey and I used to hang out here
all the time when we were little.

233
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,941
It was the best.

234
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:56,260
I can picture it so clearly.

235
00:12:57,180 --> 00:13:00,960
It's like Joey and I were here
just yesterday. That's great.

236
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:04,317
Hey, speaking of your brother,
we should go find him now.

237
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,230
Let's go.

238
00:13:05,313 --> 00:13:07,980
It would be nice if I had
a clue where Joey was.

239
00:13:08,660 --> 00:13:10,200
Let me give Taya a call.

240
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,500
That's weird.

241
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,040
Taya's not picking up.

242
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,438
That girl's always got her phone on.

243
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,313
I couldn't get through.

244
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,880
There they are.

245
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,660
Yugi, you draw the first call.

246
00:13:30,060 --> 00:13:32,177
It's the beginning of the end for you.

247
00:13:32,260 --> 00:13:35,025
I've got to figure out
a way to stop this duel.

248
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:39,157
When that anchor falls down, it's
taking one or maybe both of us with it.

249
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,697
What's the problem, Yugi?

250
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:43,015
Are you too frightened to play a card?

251
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:45,440
I don't think so, Merrick.

252
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:49,040
I summon Gazelle, the
king of mythical beasts.

253
00:13:52,140 --> 00:13:53,760
That ends my turn.

254
00:13:54,340 --> 00:13:55,260
Very well.

255
00:13:56,780 --> 00:14:01,840
Yugi, say goodbye to your Gazelle, for
I play Raigeki, which destroys him.

256
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:06,160
And now, I summon Alligator Sword!

257
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:10,120
Attack his life once directly!

258
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,160
Surrender yet?

259
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,920
Or do you want more?

260
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:23,141
I hope you're not going easy on me
because we're old friends, Yugi.

261
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,500
You'll be sorry.

262
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:26,900
We're not friends, Merrick.

263
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,937
I play Big Shield Gardener!

264
00:14:29,020 --> 00:14:31,640
Right now, in defense mode.

265
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:36,440
So, you think that's enough to protect
your life points, Yugi? So naive.

266
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,420
I play my Hinotama magic card.

267
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:44,200
Now watch closely as its power
blasts away your life points.

268
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:45,710
Yugi!

269
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:50,085
That's the second time
he attacked me directly.

270
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:54,940
Ah, that third-rate duelist Wheeler never
had cards that powerful in his deck.

271
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,800
So he is being helped.

272
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,697
Looks like Yugi's
starting to panic already

273
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:03,300
after getting a taste of my powerful deck.

274
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:06,724
Enhanced with cards
gathered by my rare hunters,

275
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,118
Joey's deck is virtually unbeatable.

276
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:11,559
Yugi will be out of my way shortly,

277
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:14,980
leaving behind his puzzle
and his Egyptian god card.

278
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:16,617
Pardon me, Master Merrick,

279
00:15:16,700 --> 00:15:20,557
but I've just learned that Joey's
sister has arrived in Battle City.

280
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:23,177
Did you say his sister? Yes, Master.

281
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:27,760
This sister of his may prove to be
an excellent pawn in my game, Odeon.

282
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:31,220
Bring the girl to me immediately. Yes.

283
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,360
Excellent work, my mind slave.

284
00:15:35,700 --> 00:15:38,957
I'll continue to use my
Millennium Rod against your former

285
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:42,280
friend until his life points
are completely wiped out.

286
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:44,077
I've got to figure a way out of this.

287
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:46,117
I've already lost half my life points.

288
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:49,357
And if I lose this duel, the
whole world is in danger.

289
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:52,617
But if I win, my best friend
gets dragged into the ocean.

290
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:54,220
There must be a solution.

291
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:58,040
Time is running out, Yugi. He's right.

292
00:15:58,260 --> 00:16:02,257
In less than an hour, that anchor drops
automatically and we're both doomed.

293
00:16:02,340 --> 00:16:03,170
Come on.

294
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,180
Heart of the cards, guide me.

295
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,600
It's my move.

296
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:11,740
I messed up big time.

297
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:13,777
I should've asked the
guys where they wanted

298
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:17,760
to meet us before I left to go
pick you up. Sorry. It's fine.

299
00:16:17,980 --> 00:16:19,686
I'm sure we'll find everyone.

300
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:21,498
Guess you're right.

301
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,060
Think about it.

302
00:16:23,380 --> 00:16:25,177
They've got to be in Battle City, right?

303
00:16:25,260 --> 00:16:27,436
So how far away could they have gone?

304
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:29,980
I'm sure I'll see my big bro in no time.

305
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,332
What are you looking at?

306
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:33,757
Hey, who are you, pungs?

307
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,546
And what do you want from us?

308
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:37,620
Tristan, what's going on?

309
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,497
Why don't you keep moving?

310
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:40,757
We don't want any trouble.

311
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:43,780
You may not want any trouble, but we do.

312
00:16:45,540 --> 00:16:50,357
Tristan, what's happening? I'm scared.
Get on my back. Okay. Let's go.

313
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,793
Don't let him get away.

314
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,620
Hey, what in the world is going on here?

315
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:57,060
Why is Yugi dueling against Joey?

316
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:59,380
Is this some sort of freaky dream?

317
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,480
No, Taya.

318
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:04,897
Some guy named Maric brainwashed
Joey and forced him into a duel.

319
00:17:04,980 --> 00:17:06,360
Why did he do that?

320
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:10,577
Maric's trying to get his evil
hands on Yugi's Egyptian god card.

321
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:13,200
So he's forcing Joey to duel for it.

322
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:15,719
This Maric guy's behind everything?

323
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:19,292
Then he must be the one Ishizu
warned us to watch out for.

324
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,778
Everything's making sense to me now.

325
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:22,990
Hey, you!

326
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,727
Stop making a fuss, will ya?

327
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:27,920
If you don't keep quiet, kid, you're done.

328
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:29,440
So don't test me.

329
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:30,597
You wouldn't do it.

330
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,977
You don't have the guts.

331
00:17:32,060 --> 00:17:32,890
You wanna bet?

332
00:17:32,973 --> 00:17:35,377
Look, Kaiba, you've gotta
stop this duel right away,

333
00:17:35,460 --> 00:17:38,577
or the whole world may be in
danger of being destroyed.

334
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:39,540
Do it now!

335
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,780
We can't. Too risky.

336
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:46,117
If we try to stop this duel now,
we'll be putting Taya in danger, Seto.

337
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,360
Let's go, Yugi.

338
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:48,877
Time is of the essence.

339
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,940
And stalling's not an option.

340
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:53,000
You know that as well as I do.

341
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:55,000
So make your move, now!

342
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:58,020
All right, time to make a move. Let's see,

343
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:00,717
his alligator sword has
1,500 attack points,

344
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:03,157
and I don't have anything
powerful enough to beat it.

345
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:05,340
But I do have Big Shield Gardner,

346
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:08,237
which has enough defense
points to keep me safe for now.

347
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:12,677
But I still need to figure out a way
to win this duel without hurting Joey.

348
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:16,817
That trap card might help me for
now, until I can figure out a plan.

349
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:18,900
Well, here goes.

350
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:21,520
I place this card face down,

351
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:28,120
and then I shall summon my Karibo
in attack mode and end my turn.

352
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:32,200
Are you playing some sort of a joke?

353
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,920
Karibo's weak.

354
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:36,520
It only has 300 attack points.

355
00:18:36,820 --> 00:18:38,737
Why would you play it in attack mode?

356
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:42,938
Unless you're trying to lose this
duel on purpose to save your friend.

357
00:18:43,320 --> 00:18:44,150
All right.

358
00:18:44,233 --> 00:18:45,197
Very well, then.

359
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:48,200
If losing is your goal,
allow me to help you.

360
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:51,900
I won't lose. Understand?

361
00:18:52,260 --> 00:18:56,580
I'll defeat you and free Joey
from your control. Wrong.

362
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:59,917
I'm afraid that this time
you're in over your head, Yugi.

363
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:03,560
So now, Alligator Sword,
attack his Karibo!

364
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,200
Hold it right there!

365
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,020
Activate face down card!

366
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,100
It's a trap!

367
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:16,900
Alligator's sword is now cocked
in my spellbinding circle!

368
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:22,420
Your monster's power has decreased
while my Karibo is safe and sound.

369
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:28,100
He weakened it, but he still has nothing
powerful enough to destroy it. Joey!

370
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,380
Don't attack!

371
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:31,400
All right, Yuki.

372
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:34,160
I've had enough of your childish games.

373
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:37,800
Now it's time for me to
regain control of this duel.

374
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,470
Ready?

375
00:19:39,553 --> 00:19:41,457
Because this worked so well last time.

376
00:19:41,540 --> 00:19:43,120
I'll use another one.

377
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:45,760
Hinokama, attack his life points!

378
00:19:48,140 --> 00:19:49,680
Yugi, no!

379
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,920
Farewell forever, Yugi!
